{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"NUM","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"民數記","commonName":"民數記","title":"民數記","order":4,"numberOfChapters":36,"sha256":"85178673aa1b8f4f59166e042dd1f8eca3a7c3393527850eb9a97150672c5b13","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NUM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":36,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NUM/36.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1267},"chapter":{"number":34,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["迦南的疆域"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華對摩西說："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「你把以下指示告訴以色列人。 「你們進入賜給你們作產業的迦南後，你們四境的疆界如下："]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["「南部疆界從荀曠野沿著以東邊界延伸，東起死海的盡頭，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["往南至亞克拉濱坡南面，經荀直到加低斯·巴尼亞南面，再延伸至哈薩·亞達，經押們，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["轉向埃及河，直到地中海。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["「西部以地中海為界，這是你們西部的邊界。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["「北部疆界從地中海開始直到何珥山，"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["從何珥山再到哈馬口，經西達達、"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["西斐崙直到哈薩·以難。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["「東部疆界從哈薩·以難一直劃到示番，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["從示番往南到亞延東面的利比拉，再往南到基尼烈湖東岸。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["然後沿約旦河南下直到死海。這是你們國土四面的疆界。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["摩西又對以色列人說：「這就是耶和華吩咐用抽籤的方式分給你們九個半支派的土地。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["呂便支派和迦得支派已經按著家係得到了他們的產業，瑪拿西半個支派也得到了他們的產業。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["這兩個半支派的產業在耶利哥對面的約旦河東岸。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["分地的首領"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["耶和華對摩西說："]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["「負責給你們分地的是以利亞撒祭司和嫩的兒子約書亞。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["每支派要選出一位首領來協助分地。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["「以下是這些首領的名字： 猶大支派耶孚尼的兒子迦勒，"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["西緬支派亞米忽的兒子示姆利，"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["便雅憫支派基斯倫的兒子以利達，"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["但支派約利的兒子布基，"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["約瑟之子瑪拿西支派以弗的兒子漢聶，"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["以法蓮支派拾弗但的兒子基姆利，"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["西布倫支派帕納的兒子以利撒番，"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["以薩迦支派阿散的兒子帕鐵，"]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":["亞設支派示羅米的兒子亞希忽，"]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":["拿弗他利支派亞米忽的兒子比達黑。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":["這些是奉耶和華之命在迦南給以色列人分產業的首領。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NUM/34.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NUM/35.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NUM/33.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":29}